[{"title":"赠八十翁何中翰迁故世庙侍臣也 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"武帝胡髯已上天，肯留方朔世间年。\n仙宫似起偷桃狱，且向莲花峰际眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42744,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"在明遗我湘竹榻走笔言谢","author":"王世贞","text":"百迭香云缀露斑，梦回身似在湘山。\n从今去后非无客，且挂高斋一壁间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42745,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答王叔承","author":"王世贞","text":"不为拈花也破颜，史多天上尽宽闲。\n隐囊一撮无劳问，中有须弥七宝山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42746,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题文待诏玄墓四景 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"虎山桥畔月如银，桃花梅花相代新。\n不须指点增惆怅，身是当年画里人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42747,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题文待诏玄墓四景 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"郁口坟前路欲迷，桃花骄杀武陵溪。\n楼头一种看山眼，不见花残衬马蹄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42748,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题文待诏玄墓四景 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"孤峰远插白云间，秀竹长松相对闲。\n听得菱歌人欲近，不知犹隔法华山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42749,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题文待诏玄墓四景 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"古塔垂倾老树奇，雾残云泄转多姿。\n而今始悟寒林色，大是丹青未竟时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42750,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和韵题扇头梅花","author":"王世贞","text":"铜坑万树玉横斜，月洗烟笼领岁华。\n棹过酒船无好句，至今犹自负梅花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42751,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐孟章索诗为赠走笔得三绝句 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"奚囊恰可诗千首，拄杖时须酒一壶。\n醉后能轻田太尉，归时那怕李金吾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42752,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐孟章索诗为赠走笔得三绝句 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"从令处士题鹦鹉，所少文君典鹔鹴。\n指口大堪容卷白，转喉何必寘雌黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42753,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐孟章索诗为赠走笔得三绝句 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"自言身世两难容，削发从归南北宗。\n不见高僧名慧地，还缘旧业有雕龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42754,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐生号云樵而以叶子雪樵书为介走笔戏成一绝句","author":"王世贞","text":"从夸范釜未生鱼，其奈劳薪桂不如。\n笑杀山人山计拙，云樵将至雪樵书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42755,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"顾母张孺人六十","author":"王世贞","text":"曾参补衮扶红日，尚忆移衾赋小星。\n四十年来丞相柏，一枝留向北堂青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42756,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张子新之兰溪 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"棹过钱塘莫厌迟，千峰倒翠插涟漪。\n居人已晓弹琴事，茂宰能歌解愠辞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42757,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张子新之兰溪 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"桐君南部尽仙官，叱石为羊也不难。\n凫舄一双须好在，金华旧省是长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42758,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陆无从茂才自扬州来乞文以赠歙人吴惟登得三绝句与之生高于诗与欧博士桢伯为广陵社 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"金徽玉轸拂尘开，流水高山信指裁。\n忽讶新声移入散，坐中人自广陵来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42759,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陆无从茂才自扬州来乞文以赠歙人吴惟登得三绝句与之生高于诗与欧博士桢伯为广陵社 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"维扬词客尽英髦，得句争夸白雪高。\n一自社中枚叟去，何人八月赋观涛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42760,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陆无从茂才自扬州来乞文以赠歙人吴惟登得三绝句与之生高于诗与欧博士桢伯为广陵社 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"乞将新序向新安，一字踌躇下笔难。\n见说龙门饶史笔，教人解作小巫看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42761,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郧襄徐中丞以春秋臆见贻有谢","author":"王世贞","text":"军城秋日静堪贪，幕府无人笔自谈。\n见说麟经新传就，千秋不数杜征南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42762,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡元瑞读鄙集有寄走笔四韵答之 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"杀青初竟未堪论，博得骊珠字字匀。\n莫信古来才一石，与君俱是斗量人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42763,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡元瑞读鄙集有寄走笔四韵答之 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"文园多病日偏长，赢得高斋看屋梁。\n便是王充新论就，可能相益蔡中郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42764,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡元瑞读鄙集有寄走笔四韵答之 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"处处松阴护药坛，何人真晓大还丹。\n知君自有灵仙骨，叱石为羊也不难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42765,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡元瑞读鄙集有寄走笔四韵答之 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"兰阴一水下兰溪，水隐花香水满堤。\n任使东流海门去，清心还向浙江西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42766,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"走笔寿表兄盛氏 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"竹林虽好未堪求，嵇阮那能到白头。\n七十古稀君自爱，何曾一醉不风流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42767,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"走笔寿表兄盛氏 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"遇酒须倾醉即眠，自称臣是酒中仙。\n仙家未必能胜此，不起贪嗔七十年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42768,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陆楚生入阳羡采茶 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"由来陆羽是茶神，着得茶经字字真。\n莫道青山无宿业，耳孙仍作采山人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42769,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陆楚生入阳羡采茶 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"阳羡春芽玉万株，新焙得似虎丘无。\n纵令王肃无情思，不与诸伧唤酪奴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42770,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀王大参阳德有寄 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"钟楼面面是横塘，每见双旌度夕阳。\n错唤小桃垂柳字，那曾一树不甘棠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42771,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀王大参阳德有寄 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"弇山春事日争新，辙迹从多不畏贫。\n所恨子猷看竹后，几曾真遇赏心人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42772,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀王大参阳德有寄 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"尝从别墅记新图，今日旸湖即鉴湖。\n自是君王多物色，可能长作客星无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42773,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀王大参阳德有寄 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"雁荡奇峰天下闻，永嘉真柑味